# THE PAPER'S FINAL SUDOKU RUNS env (2026-09-13; Documentation/Plan_2026-09-13_Paper_Final_Runs.md = the registration; the PI:
# "finish the recommended runs for the paper first, then close off Sudoku and focus on ARC"). ONE spot v6e-8 in Mumbai; the chain
# = tools/chain_paperfinal.sh (C7 C8 = C5's width-192 recipe at seeds 1/2 through the champion battery + their full-set / 50k rows;
# EqR's released weights k128 on the champion arms' identical 5k; C4's D64 on the full set). Markers under gs://qhrrn2-rescue/champ
# (the champion night's objects are read-only for this run); the live bank under champ_paper/live. Walls ~22-25 h (inferred; the
# preflight re-prices); cap launch + 36 h. SELF_TEARDOWN=0: the supervisor tears down on the final object / the sentinel.
POD=qhrrn2-pod2
ZONES="asia-south1-c"
ACCEL=v6e-8
ACCEL_LIST="v6e-8"
BIG_MAX_STRIKES=99
R_TAG=champ
R_D=192
R_STEPS=30000
ARMS="C7 C8"
CHAIN_SCRIPT=tools/chain_paperfinal.sh
CHAIN_EXTRA_ENV="GCS=gs://qhrrn2-rescue/champ LIVE_PREFIX=gs://qhrrn2-rescue/champ_paper/live"
SELF_TEARDOWN=0
WALL=129600
SENTINEL=CHAIN-PAPERFINAL-COMPLETE
GCS=gs://qhrrn2-rescue/champ
FINAL_OBJ=paperfinal_final.tgz
CANARY_CKPT=runs/pretrain6_d24/ckpt_latest.pkl
